4306338,"name":"Francesca Carrain","role":"Ester","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXIGXubO1AiAbTboYyOiOT34N9i.jpg"},{"id":1495216,"name":"Luigi Di Fiore","role":"Armando","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q8fA1C8MKNkbXNrDzrb4u1tUjQS.jpg"},{"id":1921128,"name":"Paola Sambo","role":"Paolina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/349mP2yE6jpQXQ4QDNdODWD1b4P.jpg"},{"id":3696366,"name":"Valentina Filippeschi","role":"Miriam","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iH847WUCyp3dhGvjZ5fMFecbFZQ.jpg"},{"id":2019020,"name":"Simone Guarany","role":"Primo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7lw1zmEhE6gGiqpBgCQMuio286.jpg"},{"id":3203552,"name":"Silvia D'Amico","role":"Silvia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d8TmCRsLktYGNSTDSQoxMzAgjm9.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"In un casolare di campagna fermo nel tempo, vive una famiglia estremamente religiosa, di quelle cristiane che seguono alla lettera le Scritture del Vecchio Testamento. Le tre figlie non hanno mai abbandonato la proprietà spinte da rispetto, dovere e sotto l’egida di un padre padrone e una nonna dogmatica. Il momento comune della Confessione è forse il più importante tra le attività della giornata: la chiude e ne conserva gli aspetti per cui fare ammenda. Le tre sorelle, infatti, sono costrette a rivelare ogni loro azione e pensiero recondito. L’arrivo al casolare di un altro nipote della nonna scatenerà sulle ragazze sensazioni e decisioni che cambieranno per sempre la loro vita."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Sara, Ester, and Miriam are three sisters who have never left the farmhouse where their father and grandmother raised them. They venerate God because they are an extremely Christian family, and fully respect the dogmas and punishments that the Scriptures, and the Old Testament above all, have transmitted to them. They believe in no intermediary, no Church, and no sacred image: Grandma Paolina rises to all those roles that separate them from the Lord’s grace. Adolescence, however, has brought with it questions and physical transformations that have changed the sisters’ outlooks. The doubt that sin has penetrated into their minds and hands is a legitimate one, and each of them responds differently to their first sexual urges. When tragedy strikes the family and their young cousin Primo is forced to come to the farmhouse, the sisters’ lives are forever changed."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1AJRRxgxLwXU1YurpKQW890KSx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m1AJRRxgxLwXU1YurpKQW890KSx.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIzJ1njU1ZVhR1cwK8lqvJZeyBf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gIzJ1njU1ZVhR1cwK8lqvJZeyBf.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f0Bm0YVHfIQ7L7IX8qNxQNiaw8z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f0Bm0YVHfIQ7L7IX8qNxQNiaw8z.jpg","language":"xx","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zypZgmnuYeW1v2BQERreb6ObxbI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zypZgmnuYeW1v2BQERreb6ObxbI.jpg","language":"xx","width":3840,"height":2160},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3TDlb6bsRlDZGCunlRL1S2Xsf9U.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3TDlb6bsRlDZGCunlRL1S2Xsf9U.jpg","language":"xx","width":3210,"height":1803}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1AJRRxgxLwXU1YurpKQW890KSx.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zypZgmnuYeW1v2BQERreb6ObxbI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1222174,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available"